 - 新增 16 项纯离线回归，验证 GPU 设置保留/幂等、期限、迟到匹配、取消及任务放行边界。离线通过不等于实机验收。
 
 The local overlay prepares BitBlt compatibility before creating the game process, preserves other GPU settings, bounds startup readiness with a monotonic deadline, and prevents task nodes after unverified startup. Existing visual criteria and upstream licensing remain unchanged. Diagnostics contain scalar values only; no authentication screenshots are stored automatically.
+
+## 2026-10-11 天赋 OCR 诊断与严格解析 / Talent OCR diagnosis and strict parsing
+
+`local-character-talent-fix-2026-10-11.patch` 是在完整迁移补丁和启动修复之后单次应用的独立修改，保留前两份补丁。每帧重新核验天赋详情标签后才允许有界 OCR 文本/坐标诊断；不保存图像。类型要求唯一标签，等级要求完整的 1–15 单值并拒绝数字片段拼接。加成区域属于条件布局：正文或空白不证明无加成；只有已核验白色等级字形、合法基础范围且无冲突时返回无加成，青字则必须同时有完整唯一 `天赋等级+3` 和合法显示等级。颜色模糊、暗色冲突或标签矛盾为未知。
+
+原类型/等级/加成 OCR ROI 保持不变，独立颜色采样 padding 用于可靠背景估计。连续三次三元组一致、三个天赋完整核实及档案未知边界保持不变。72 项纯逻辑与 7 项私人页面的双尺寸同 Core 回放通过；静态夹具重复不等于独立实机帧，也未把离线修复称为实机验收通过。
+
+The additional overlay verifies the talent-detail context before bounded text diagnostics and rejects ambiguous talent types, levels and bonus markers. It combines verified level-glyph evidence with the conditional bonus-label layout, preserves three consecutive samples and unknown outcomes, and shares one frame parser between production and private deterministic replay. OCR coordinates remain unchanged; extra color-sampling padding estimates the background. Offline and compressed-frame tests do not establish live BitBlt recognition success.
 
